  "historyNote": "(See Revision Notes #1, #2, #3, and #4 at Chapter heading for Env-Wt 100) #12801, eff 12-15-19; ss by #12953, eff 12-24-19; ss by #13945, eff 4-27-24 (formerly Env-Wt 104.19) (See Revision Note #5 at chapter heading for Env-Wt 100)",
